[? if right_dominant_sn == 1 : The Senat is dominated by the right, this will limit the scope of left wing governments and benefit right wing governments. ?][? if left_dominant_sn : The Senat is dominated by the left, this eill limit the scope of right wing governments and benefit left wing governments. ?][? if center_dominant_sn : The Senat is dominated by the centrists. ?]
